  "notable_quotes": [
    "The framework forms a 3D porous structure with 1D narrow channels and 23.4% void volume, while each triazolate leaves a third N atom available as a guest-binding site.",
    "A flexible Zn(II)-bis-triazolate framework with paired uncoordinated triazolate N donors was designed to provide guest-chelating sites for high CO2 adsorption enthalpy and CO2/N2 selectivity.",
    "Monodentate CO2-binding sites are a tradeoff: chemical absorption hinders CO2 release, while physical adsorption is reversible but has low CO2 affinity and selectivity."
  ],
